{
    "title": "Pogo: Earn Cash & Rewards",
    "description": "Play rewarded games, scan receipts, and fill out surveys to unlock cash rewards and savings effortlessly. Transform everyday actions into earning real money with Pogo.\r\n\r\nCASH BACK ON EVERYTHING\r\n\u25a0 Earn Cash Back Rewards: Connect your bank account and start earning cash back on everything you buy, including groceries, gas, rent, and more. Get even more cash rewards on purchases from Amazon, Target, Walmart, UberEats, and all your favorite brands. Love using coupons? You\u2019ll love Pogo\u2014it\u2019s a brand-new way to make money on top of the coupons you\u2019re already using.\r\n\r\nSCAN AND EARN MONEY\r\n\u25a0 Receipt Rewards: Turn your receipts into instant cashback using our simple receipt scanner. Every purchase becomes more rewarding with extra rewards.\r\n\r\nPLAY GAMES FOR CASH\r\n\u25a0 Play to Earn: Play mobile games where leveling up isn\u2019t just about fun\u2014it\u2019s about earning cash rewards too. Enjoy games like bingo, puzzles, merge games, and more, and watch your rewards grow as you progress. Play games and earn money while you have fun.\r\n\r\nANSWER SURVEYS FOR MONEY\r\n\u25a0 Paid Surveys: Share your opinions, take quick surveys, and get rewarded for your time and thoughts. It\u2019s an easy way to earn cash for sharing your insights.\r\n\r\nFINALLY GET PAID FOR YOUR OWN DATA\r\n\u25a0 Data Rewards: Sharing data is entirely up to you, and it pays off. We respect your data and offer rewards for your trust. Only share what you want, when you want, and you can stop anytime. Get cash rewards for the data you choose to share.\r\n\r\nCASH OUT MADE EASY\r\n\u25a0 Quick Transfers: No more waiting. Transfer your cash swiftly to Venmo or PayPal\u2014your money is always ready when you are.\r\n\u25a0 Smooth Process: We make the cash-out process as smooth as your earnings.\r\n\r\nADDITIONAL FEATURES\r\n\u25a0 Rewards for Shopping: Get rewarded for shopping with major retailers like Walmart, Amazon, and Target.\r\n\u25a0 Location-Based Rewards: Unlock exclusive deals by sharing your location. Earn points and get cash rewards while visiting your favorite places.\r\n\u25a0 Drive to Save: Earn discounted auto insurance rates by sharing your location and improving your driving score.\r\n\r\nDOWNLOAD POGO TODAY\r\nJoin us and start earning cash rewards and saving effortlessly every day. Turn simple tasks into cash and money rewards. Make every day count with Pogo.\r\n\r\nNote: Location-based features require foreground service permission. You can stop sharing your location anytime in the app settings.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Play rewarded games, scan receipts, and fill out surveys to unlock cash rewards and savings effortlessly. Transform everyday actions into earning real money with Pogo.<br><br>CASH BACK ON EVERYTHING<br>\u25a0 Earn Cash Back Rewards: Connect your bank account and start earning cash back on everything you buy, including groceries, gas, rent, and more. Get even more cash rewards on purchases from Amazon, Target, Walmart, UberEats, and all your favorite brands. Love using coupons? You\u2019ll love Pogo\u2014it\u2019s a brand-new way to make money on top of the coupons you\u2019re already using.<br><br>SCAN AND EARN MONEY<br>\u25a0 Receipt Rewards: Turn your receipts into instant cashback using our simple receipt scanner. Every purchase becomes more rewarding with extra rewards.<br><br>PLAY GAMES FOR CASH<br>\u25a0 Play to Earn: Play mobile games where leveling up isn\u2019t just about fun\u2014it\u2019s about earning cash rewards too. Enjoy games like bingo, puzzles, merge games, and more, and watch your rewards grow as you progress. Play games and earn money while you have fun.<br><br>ANSWER SURVEYS FOR MONEY<br>\u25a0 Paid Surveys: Share your opinions, take quick surveys, and get rewarded for your time and thoughts. It\u2019s an easy way to earn cash for sharing your insights.<br><br>FINALLY GET PAID FOR YOUR OWN DATA<br>\u25a0 Data Rewards: Sharing data is entirely up to you, and it pays off. We respect your data and offer rewards for your trust. Only share what you want, when you want, and you can stop anytime. Get cash rewards for the data you choose to share.<br><br>CASH OUT MADE EASY<br>\u25a0 Quick Transfers: No more waiting. Transfer your cash swiftly to Venmo or PayPal\u2014your money is always ready when you are.<br>\u25a0 Smooth Process: We make the cash-out process as smooth as your earnings.<br><br>ADDITIONAL FEATURES<br>\u25a0 Rewards for Shopping: Get rewarded for shopping with major retailers like Walmart, Amazon, and Target.<br>\u25a0 Location-Based Rewards: Unlock exclusive deals by sharing your location. Earn points and get cash rewards while visiting your favorite places.<br>\u25a0 Drive to Save: Earn discounted auto insurance rates by sharing your location and improving your driving score.<br><br>DOWNLOAD POGO TODAY<br>Join us and start earning cash rewards and saving effortlessly every day. Turn simple tasks into cash and money rewards. Make every day count with Pogo.<br><br>Note: Location-based features require foreground service permission. You can stop sharing your location anytime in the app settings.",
